123 M9
124 L X+15 Y+5 R0 FMAX
125 L Z+10 R0 FMAX
126 L X+15 Y+5 Z+10 R0 FMAX
127 L X+15 Y+5 Z+6 R0 FMAX
128 CYCL DEF 206 TAPPING NEW ~
  Q200=+1 ~
  Q201=-8 ~
  Q206=+500 ~
  Q211=+0.2 ~
  Q203=+5 ~
  Q204=+1
129 CYCL CALL
130 L X+15 Y+5 Z+7 R0 FMAX
131 L X+15 Y+5 Z+10 R0 FMAX
